{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "name": "Preview Phrase",
  "description": "What a block preview plays into an effect (DECISIONS D190): two bars at 120 BPM of drums (kick, snare, hats from noise and sines), a vi–IV–I–V chord pad, and an arpeggio. Its outputs also drive instruments: `notes` (the chords) for polyphonic blocks, `melody`, `gate`, and `freq` (the arpeggio) for monophonic ones, and `kick`, `snare`, `hat` for trigger inputs. To hear it, open this file in the editor (it joins the library) and add it.",
